      },
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "label": "text",
      "prov": [],
      "orig": "Deficit irrigation supplied 70% of crop evapotranspiration to field tomatoes over the 2024 and 2025 seasons. Marketable yield fell by 6% against full irrigation, while water use fell by 28%, so that water productivity rose from 18.4 to 23.9 kg per cubic metre.",
      "text": "Deficit irrigation supplied 70% of crop evapotranspiration to field tomatoes over the 2024 and 2025 seasons. Marketable yield fell by 6% against full irrigation, while water use fell by 28%, so that water productivity rose from 18.4 to 23.9 kg per cubic metre."
    },
    {
      "self_ref": "#/texts/5",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/texts/0"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/texts/6"
